<title>USA: Excel Tech to redeem warrants.</title>
<headline>Excel Tech to redeem warrants.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excel Technology Inc on Wednesday said that it was exercising its right to redeem all Class B warrants.</p>
<p>Each warrant entitles the holder to purchase one share of common stock at $8 per share.</p>
<p>The redemption date of the warrants is February 21.</p>
<p>Excel Tech stock was unchanged at 8-5/8.</p>
</text>
